Package: oosysctl
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: KERNEL PARAMS
 Inspects and sets Linux kernel parameters at runtime under /proc/sys/.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
